      "items": [
        "VPC 10.42.0.0/16・非公開サブネット×2 AZ",
        "IPv6 egress-only IGW / DB は TCP 5432",
        "Cognito・Secrets Manager を利用"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "採点の分離",
      "items": [
        "worker は DB 接続なし・VPC peering なし",
        "SQS 経由で要求取得・結果送信",
        "設定: enabled=true / SSH 無効"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "公開・運用",
      "items": [
        "Route 53＋ACM: www / api.share-oj.net",
        "CloudWatch → SNS → 通知 Lambda → Discord",
        "Terraform 定義の図。実稼働は未照合"
